OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds object to homes on
OL,4,AShrovetide Football site
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of objections have been made
OL,7,Fover plans to build up to 250 homes on
OL,8,Fland historically used during the Royal
OL,9,FShrovetide Football game in Derbyshire.
OL,11,FHallam Land Management (HLM) wants to
OL,12,Fbuild the properties on fields off The
OL,13,FGreen Road in Ashbourne. The developer
OL,14,Fhas also tabled a near identical
OL,15,Fapplication, albeit a smaller scale, in
OL,16,Fthe same area for 175 homes.
OL,18,FMore than 670 residents have now signed
OL,19,Fa petition objecting to the scheme and
OL,20,Furging Derbyshire Dales District
OL,21,FCouncil to reject the proposal.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
