OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds object to homes on
OL,4,AShrovetide Football site
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrett O'Connell, who organised the
OL,7,Fpetition, said: "There's a lot of anger
OL,8,Fand a feeling of despair."
